<%# v1.12 (Session 70): Owner Part Number feature. Added a "Component Owner %>
<%#   Part Number" text field to Row 2, between the component's own DEC Part %>
<%#   Number and DEC Serial Number fields (grouping the three identifier %>
<%#   fields together). Row 2 grid widened from grid-cols-4 to grid-cols-5 to %>
<%#   fit the new column. Field permitted in components_controller.rb v2.1. %>
<%#   No JS/Stimulus wiring needed — Owner Part Number is a plain text field, %>
<%#   not part of the component-suggestion typeahead (that only concerns %>
<%#   order_number/description/serial_number, per component_suggestion_controller.js). %>
<%# v1.11: UI rename — "Order Number" -> "DEC Part Number", "Serial Number" -> %>
<%#   "DEC Serial Number", wherever those phrases appear as label text or in %>
<%#   descriptive comments (both the Computer* read-only fields and the %>
